: STAGER N:D: FIXTURE :CHAR:EA:SEE SRC/FORMATS/STAGEL/DOCS/SRN:D:.MD FOR FULL SPECIFICATION:CHAR:EB:.
: EXERCISES STAGER N:D: TYPES :CHAR:EA:S:CHAR:EE: DC:CHAR:EE: DCS:CHAR:EE: IN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: UN:B:N:C:N:I::CHAR:EE: INT:CHAR:EE: RAT:CHAR:EE: VIEW:CHAR:EE: CURSOR:CHAR:EE: OPTION/T:CHAR:EE: RESULT/T:CHAR:EB::CHAR:EE: BARE :CHAR:DE:...:CHAR:DE: DCTS LITERALS:CHAR:EE: AND INLINE ANONYMOUS ROUTINE CALLS.

V/B/ZL S/IN
    TEST WORKS WITH ZERO LENGTH STRING
        IN ""
        OUT TRUE
    TEST WORKS WITH NONZERO LENGTH STRING
        IN "/XGB"
        OUT FALSE
    EQ UN:G:N:E::N:A: BYTELEN /IN.

V/RESULT/IN:G:N:E:/ADDCHECKED IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B :: SUM /A /B.
V/RESULT/IN:G:N:E:/ADDTHREE IN:G:N:E:/A IN:G:N:E:/B IN:G:N:E:/C :: SUM SUM/ /A /B /C.
V/OPTION/S/FIRSTPART L/S/PARTS :: OPTION/S:SOME AT/ /PARTS UN:G:N:E::N:A:.

V/S/DEFAULT S/A S/B :: IF ZL /A /B /A.

V/IN:B:N:C:N:I:/PASSWIDE IN:B:N:C:N:I:/X
    TEST PRESERVES NEGATIVE WIDE INTEGER
        IN IN:B:N:C:N:I::N:M:N:E:N:C:
        OUT IN:B:N:C:N:I::N:M:N:E:N:C:
    /X.

V/OPTION/UN:D:N:C:/NONZEROORNONE UN:D:N:C:/X
    TEST WRAPS NONZERO VALUE
        IN UN:D:N:C::N:F:
        OUT OPTION/UN:D:N:C::SOME UN:D:N:C::N:F:
    IF EQ UN:D:N:C::N:A: /X
        OPTION/UN:D:N:C::NONE
        OPTION/UN:D:N:C::SOME /X.

V/VOID/SKIPIFEMPTY S/IN :: IF ZL /IN NOP NOP.

V/L/S/SPLITDCTS S/SEP S/INPUT
    TEST SPLITS MIXED MODE STRING WITH EMBEDDED DC TOKEN
        IN ":" "/XGB/XGM/XHA/XGI/XGB:/XEA/XDC/XDF/XDG/XEA:/XGC/XGF/XHE/XGB"
        OUT L/S: "/XGB/XGM/XHA/XGI/XGB" "/XEA/XDC/XDF/XDG/XEA" "/XGC/XGF/XHE/XGB" ::
    PIECES /SEP /INPUT.

: INLINE ANONYMOUS ROUTINE CALLS :CHAR:EA:DC N:C:N:C:N:B:N:B:..N:C:N:C:N:B:N:C: OVER DC N:C:N:C:N:E:N:A:..N:C:N:C:N:E:N:B::CHAR:EB: AND REC :CHAR:EA:DC N:C:N:C:N:E:N:C::CHAR:EB: SELF:CHAR:EF:RECURSION.
: MULTI:CHAR:EF:LINE BODIES INDENT :CHAR:ED:N:I: SPACES AND CLOSING :CHAR:DE::::CHAR:DE: INDENTS :CHAR:ED:N:E: SPACES FROM THE STATEMENT START.
V/RESULT/UN:D:N:C:/INLINEROUTINECALL UN:D:N:C:/N UN:D:N:C:/SEED
    TEST CAPTURES LEXICAL BINDING AND TAIL RECURSES VIA REC
        IN UN:D:N:C::N:E: UN:D:N:C::N:B:N:A:
        OUT RESULT/UN:D:N:C::OK UN:D:N:C::N:C:N:F:
    HOLD UN:D:N:C:/ACC /SEED.
    V/VOID UN:D:N:C:/DELTA ::
            BECOME /ACC WRAPSUM /ACC /DELTA.
        :: UN:D:N:C::N:F:.
    BE UN:D:N:C:/TOTAL V/RESULT/UN:D:N:C:/ UN:D:N:C:/REM UN:D:N:C:/CUR ::
            IF EQ /REM UN:D:N:C::N:A:
                RESULT/UN:D:N:C::OK /CUR
                REC DIFF/ /REM UN:D:N:C::N:B: SUM/ /CUR /REM.
        :: /N /ACC.
    RESULT/UN:D:N:C::OK /TOTAL.
